# A Question of Taste: Jakoh's Events (accepted 46 / 48; completed 52 / 56) alternate with his script (interaction_lookup's
# UseFallback var: an Event-priority reply sets it, and the next talk runs his script first). TuningOut_Progress 2 (a GM)
# makes his script start 294 (its finish sets nothing). A level 75 Warrior at Windurst fame 425, A Question of Taste
# accepted at Prog 0 (a GM): 46, then his script's 294; Prog 2: 48, then 294. Completed (a GM, Prog 2 kept) with the
# mustZone (Quest[5][3]mustZone 250, set in Kazham by a GM): 52, then 294; the mustZone cleared and Prog 1 (GMs): 56,
# then 294.
lists Kazham/Jakoh_Wahcondalo/onTrigger
char zone=Kazham pos=101.702,-15.023,-115.841 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Windurst 425
quest Outlands.AQuestionOfTaste accepted
charvar TuningOut_Progress 2
login
trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo                # Prog 0: 46
finish
trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo                # his script's turn: 294
finish
charvar Quest[5][3]Prog 2               # a GM
trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo                # Prog 2: 48
finish
trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo                # his script's turn: 294
finish
quest Outlands.AQuestionOfTaste completed   # a GM: Prog 2 kept
charvar Quest[5][3]mustZone 250         # a GM: the mustZone, set in Kazham
trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo                # completed, the mustZone: 52
finish
trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo                # his script's turn: 294
finish
charvar Quest[5][3]mustZone 0           # a GM
charvar Quest[5][3]Prog 1               # a GM
trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo                # completed, Prog 1: 56
finish
trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo                # his script's turn: 294
finish
